// Prover-key size note citing servicedesk#203.
// Large prover keys (90–570 MB reported) make client-side proving impractical.
// Prefer circuits that stay practical for local prove with Compact ~0.31.1.
// This file is a comment-only invariant; it does not invent APIs.
